  "description": "Experience Everyday Freedom with Dexter – Your Ultimate Portable Emojo Electric Trike\nMeet the Dexter, the Emojo electric trike that redefines convenience and comfort in your daily commute. Designed with a low step-through frame and Harley-style handlebars, the Dexter makes riding a breeze, whether you're navigating through the city streets or enjoying a leisurely cruise. With an impressive battery range of up to 60 miles on a single charge, your journeys are no longer limited by distance.\nThis innovative electric bike is perfect for those seeking a blend of style and functionality. Its 500W DC brushless motor allows you to reach speeds of up to 20 MPH, ensuring you arrive at your destination quickly. Plus, the built-in differential and hydraulic brakes provide superior stability and control for a safe and enjoyable ride.\n\nAvailable in 4 stylish colors to match your personality\nArrives 95% assembled for hassle-free setup\nLightweight aluminum alloy frame at only 93 lbs (with battery)\n7-speed transmission for versatile riding experiences\nMax user weight capacity of 300 lbs – ideal for various riders\n\nWhether you want to conquer steep hills or enjoy a relaxed ride, the Dexter is your reliable partner for everyday adventures. Don’t wait – embrace the freedom of effortless travel today with Dexter!",
